{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50784","headline":"观《山海图》二首 其二 · 张祜","name":"观《山海图》二首 其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何人笔思狂，一壁尽沧浪。\n日月明丹拱，烟云起画梁。\n山岚开晓色，海气动秋光。\n岛踞鳌睛大，沙行鰐齿长。\n粉波明百越，黛点簇三湘。\n讵作无图意，空迷造化乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}